<description>&lt;p&gt;The Colombian Army carried out an airstrike in Nariño that killed eight ELN members, and a separate bombing in the southwest also left eight ELN fighters dead. President De la Espriella has launched a total offensive against the ELN and dissident FARC forces in Arauca, expanding the government's military campaign. A drone attack injured six police officers at a station, while a Black Hawk crash stranded thirteen soldiers in Cauca. A gold mine collapse in southwestern Colombia killed fourteen miners and injured seven, and a gang killed a preacher. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxNaDh0MXV1bHB4VlFMWlBZamp3cWJITzRXR2xRbFZkLVViYUxWN19kMnZCbXBadEhmX19OVlB1d3p5RnkwSmctT3VOcEQ5bnU1MEFTcUF2OXZTVmhmdnFyaHhERFdBdlZSUk0tQlpQUDk4c2lBV2d1SWM4ZWJ4ODlnSHRfXzhBUmhrUzFEZFFsNmxIcFNNWld5TDhxeUc2Z0Q4S3hqLUdQT1l6NVBHSV8tcVVJcHlHaE1icTNPa1FR0gG-AUFVX3lxTE1oOHQxdXVscHhWUUxaUFlqandxYkhPNFdHbFFsVmQtVWJhTFY3X2QydkJtcFp0SGZfX05WUHV3enlGeTBKZy1PdU5wRDludTUwQVNxQXY5dlNWaGZ2cXJoeEREV0F2VlJSTS1CWlBQOThzaUFXZ3VJYzhlYng4OWdIdF9fOEFSaGtTMURkUWw2bEhwU01aV3lMOHF5RzZnRDhLeGotR1BPWXo1UEdJXy1xVUlweUdoTWJxM09rUVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQWGFFVjBQc2Vma0RHUEtIVEJ3d3BPMjM5WXU1OVZsQ3cyYnpJNzByd0RSQUw3OUpjT3NjWkd3VXRWd1ZNWTNXZTN0S2FMSXhSWmh5MUM2a18tSUx3QVhkS1ktVUdjc0xYbXRvcGtId050SG9TUGhmZHBoaGN6cUIzamdpTEpvMGZTaDcyX09ZTWNmZVFRUXY1MlRfZnR5V1d3bVVPYlFpS3d1WnZSakJhOVdBRkdacW5qTFpKNw?oc=5&quot;&gt;JFeed&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://n